04,5109602,0000,0102,0,'I~want~to~upgrade~my~blessed~equipment. 5109605'),(5109602,5109603,0000,0102,0,'How~can~I~upgrade~my~blessed~attribute? 5109610'),(5109603,9518721,0000,0102,0,'What`s~the~use~of~this~oven? 5060550'),(9518721,610067,0000,0102,0,'How~to~compose~+n~items? 9518725'),(9518725,9518726,0000,0101,0,'It\'s called the WuxingOven. It has marvelous magic powers. It can be used to enchant your weapons with a gem.'),(9518726,9518727,0000,0101,0,' The enchanted weapon will increase your maximum HP and it can also help to compose your equipment'),(9518727,9518728,0000,0102,0,'Tell~me~more~about~enchanted~items. 5109635'),(9518728,610067,0000,0102,0,'Tell~me~more~about~equipment~composition. 5060560'),(5060560,5060561,0000,0101,0,'You can obtain Composition Points from minor items and make your main items reach the next bonus level.'),(5060561,5060562,0000,0101,0,' Items, which are locked or with the highest Battle Power of its type can not be composed as the minor item.'),(5060562,5060563,0000,0102,0,'What~about~the~remainder~after~the~composition? 5060570'),(5060563,610067,0000,0102,0,'Can~I~use~Dragonballs~to~compose? 5060580'),(5060580,5060581,0000,0101,0,'No, you cannot. You can only use +1 +8 items or Stones to compose items to be +9 or above'),(5060581,5060582,0000,0101,0,''),(5060582,610067,0000,0102,0,'Got~it,~thanks 0'),(5060570,5060571,0000,0101,0,'It adds to the total of the main items for the next level. For example, a +3 main item, which requires 240 to level'),(5060571,5060572,0000,0101,0,' up, is compo with a +4 minor item, which grants 360 Composition Points. The original +3 item becomes a +4'),(5060572,5060573,0000,0101,0,' item with 120 Composition Points remaining'),(5060573,610067,0000,0102,0,'Thanks.~I~never~knew. 0'),(5109635,5109638,0000,0101,0,'The~enchanted~weapon~can~increase~up~to~255~HP.~The~higher~quality~gem~will~enchant~higher~HP.~The~enchanted~effects'),(5109638,5109636,0000,0101,0,'also~vary~with~the~type~of~the~gem.~Your~luck~is~a~very~important~factor,~too.'),(5109636,5109637,0000,0102,0,'Can~my~weapon~be~enchanted~repeatedly? 5109645'),(5109637,610067,0000,0102,0,'What~gems~are~required? 5109640'),(5109640,5109641,0000,0101,0,'They~can~be~Dragon,~Phoenix,~Tortoise,~Rainbow,~Moon,~Violet,~Fury,~or~Kylin.~The~enchanted~effects~vary~with~the~gem~quality.'),(5109641,610067,0000,0102,0,'I~see.~Thanks. 0'),(5109645,5109646,0000,0101,0,'Sure.~You~can~re-enchant~your~weapon.~If~the~new~attribute~is~higher,~it~will~replace~the~old~one,~otherwise,~it~won`t~replace.'),(5109646,610067,0000,0102,0,'I~see.~Thanks. 0'),(5060550,5060551,0000,0101,0,'You may promote the bonus level of items in Wuxing Oven, namely compose +n items. +n item have'),(5060551,5060552,0000,0101,0,' +n stats which can make your items much more powerful'),(5060552,5060553,0000,0101,0,''),(5060553,610067,0000,0102,0,'Oh,~I~see. 0'),(5109610,5109620,0000,0101,0,'Only~blessed~equipment~can~be~upgraded.~Super~Tortoise~Gems~are~required.~After~blessed~attribute~is~upgraded,~more'),(5109620,5109621,0000,0101,0,'damages~taken~will~be~reduced.~When~blessed~attribute~reaches~level~4~(the~highest),~the~damage~taken~will~be~reduced~by~7%.'),(5109621,610067,0000,0102,0,'How~many~super~Tortoise~Gems~are~required? 5109625'),(5109625,5110965,0000,0101,0,'If~you~want~to~upgrade~your~blessed~attribute~to~level~2,~you~must~have~level -1~blessed~equipment~and~a~Super~Tortiuse Gem.'),(5110965,5109626,0000,0101,0,''),(5109626,5110966,0000,0101,0,' After it is upgraded to level 2, the damage taken will be reduced by 3. If you want to upgrade your blessed atribute to level'),(5110966,5109627,0000,0101,0,' 3, you must have level-2 blessed equiment and 3 super Tortoise Gems. After it is upgraded to level 3, the damage taken will be'),(5109627,5110967,0000,0101,0,' reduced by 5. If you want to upgrade your blessed attribute to level 4, you must have level-3 blessed equipment and 5 Super'),(5110967,5109628,0000,0101,0,' Tortoise Gems. After it is upgr