e Praying Stone(S) is for 3 days of Blessing, and the'),(5042591,5042592,0000,0101,0,'~Praying Stone(M) is for 7 days of Blessing. Correspondingly, the Praying Stone(L) is for 30 days of Blessing. You can choose'),(5042592,5042593,0000,0101,0,'~one of these Praying Stones you have to get the relevant blessing time.'),(5042593,5042594,0000,0101,0,''),(5042594,5042595,0000,0102,0,'Oh,~I~see.~Let~me~choose~again. 5042520'),(5042595,610006,0000,0102,0,'Sorry,~I~forgot~something. 0'),(5042520,5042521,0000,0101,0,'You will have Heaven Blessing if you get Praying Stones. With a Praying Stone(s), you can have 3 days of Blessing.'),(5042521,5042522,0000,0101,0,'~With a Praying Stones(M), you`ll get 7 days of Blessing. You can have 30 days of Blessing with a Praying Stone(L).'),(5042522,5042523,0000,0102,0,'I~have~a~PrayingStone(S). 5042540'),(5042523,5042524,0000,0102,0,'I~have~a~PrayingStone(M). 5042560'),(5042524,5042525,0000,0102,0,'I~have~a~PrayingStone(L). 5042580'),(5042525,5042526,0000,0102,0,'What~is~HeavenBlessing~exactly? 5042600'),(5042526,610006,0000,0102,0,'I~don`t~have~any~PrayingStones. 0'),(5042600,5042601,0000,0101,0,'In~a~word,~you~can~benefit~a~lot~from~HeavenBlessing.~In~blessed~days,~you~will~get~extra~20~percent~experience'),(5042601,5042602,0000,0101,0,'points~from~killing~monsters,~and~your~stamina~will~be~increased~by~50~points.~Moreover~you~will~get~1-hour~double'),(5042602,5042603,0000,0101,0,'~experience every day. Players without Heaven Blessing will be cursed when killing you and you will be able to revive at the'),(5042603,5042604,0000,0101,0,'~place where you are killed.'),(5042604,5042605,0000,0102,0,'Cool!~I~got~a~Praying~Stone. 5042520'),(5042605,610006,0000,0102,0,'Brilliant,~I~should~buy~one~now. 0'),(5042580,5042581,5042590,0502,1200002,''),(5042581,6042012,0000,1027,0,'self bless'),(6042012,1260540,5042582,0144,8,'=='),(1260540,1260551,1260541,1001,0,'vip == 1'),(1260551,5042586,0000,1083,0,'+= 792'),(5042586,5042585,0000,0105,0,'Since~