d right-click it to equip. It`s as easy as that! Oh, and to sell an item, you just drag and drop to my shop!'),(10518,10512,0000,0102,0,'What~about~repairs? 10192'),(10521,10522,0000,0101,0,'First, unequip the item by double-clicking it in your status window. Then find me, click my repair button and click the item.'),(10522,10512,0000,0102,0,'Any~other~tips? 10193'),(10531,10543,0000,0101,0,'Yeah, some items are high quality: normal, refined, unique, elite, super. That`s specialist stuff, only found in the market.'),(10543,10544,0000,0101,0,'That~is~all.~If~you~have~not~talked~to~other~NPCs,~you~had~better~have~a~chat~with~them~so~that~you~can~learn~more.'),(10544,10513,0000,0102,0,'Thanks. 0'),(10550,10551,0000,0101,0,'Welcome!~I~run~a~warehouse~in~every~city.~You~can~store~your~money~and~items~in~my~warehouses,~and~retrieve~them~for~free.'),(10551,10552,0000,0102,0,'Cool.~How~do~I~use~them? 10201'),(10552,10553,0000,0102,0,'Consult~others. 0'),(10553,10554,0000,0104,0,'10 10 10'),(10554,0000,0000,0120,0,''),(10555,10556,0000,0101,0,'First, you find my warehouse men in your city, click on him and see your storage box open up. To deposit money, enter the'),(10556,10557,0000,0101,0,'~amount in the blank field before clicking Deposit. Withdrawing money is the same. If you want to put items in your'),(10557,10558,0000,0101,0,'~storage space, just drag and drop. Taking them out only requires one click. Also, your money is totalled from all warehouses.'),(10558,10553,0000,0102,0,'I~see.~Thanks. 0'),(10560,10561,0000,0101,0,'Armorers swear only to provide the very best in defense. Whether it`s robes or helmets, we stock it all.'),(10561,10562,0000,0102,0,'I~see.~Where~can~I~find~an~armorer? 10211'),(10562,10563,0000,0102,0,'Consult~others. 0'),(10563,10564,0000,0104,0,'10 10 7'),(10564,0000,0000,0120,0,''),(10565,10566,0000,0101,0,'Every city or major settlement has one. But our armors vary from place to place. Some armorers have better helms, while others'),(10566,10567,0000,0101,0,'~specialize in mail or helms. Just be sure to buy armor without red text in the description. You won`t be able to wear those!'),(10567,10563,0000,0102,0,'I~see.~Thanks. 0'),(10570,10571,0000,0101,0,'Hi!~I~am~selling~all~kinds~of~potions~and~City~Gate~Scrolls~in~the~cities.~I~also~sell~fireworks~and~skill~books~in~the~market.'),(10571,10572,0000,0102,0,'What~potions? 10221'),(10572,10573,0000,0102,0,'Consult~others. 0'),(10573,10574,0000,0104,0,'10 10 1'),(10574,0000,0000,0120,0,''),(10575,10576,0000,0101,0,'Healing~and~mana~potions.~Healing~potions~can~make~you~healthy,~and~mana~potions~will~enable~you~to~cast~spells.'),(10576,10577,0000,0101,0,'That~is~all.~If~you~have~not~talked~to~other~NPCs,~you~had~better~have~a~chat~with~them~so~that~you~can~learn~more.'),(10577,10573,0000,0102,0,'I~see.~Thanks. 0'),(10580,10581,10590,1001,0,'profession == 100'),(10581,10582,0000,0101,0,'Wah! My only friend left! Walked through the gate and never came back... I`m scared and lonely. Do you wanna be my friend?'),(10582,10583,0000,0102,0,'Um...~okay,~sure! 10231'),(10583,10584,0000,0102,0,'Not~a~chance.~Leave~me~be! 0'),(10584,10585,0000,0104,0,'10 10 6'),(10585,0000,0000,0120,0,''),(10586,10587,0000,0101,0,'Yipee! You`re a taoist, right? Taoists are good spellcasters, and they can use backswords! I always wanted on of those!'),(10587,10588,0000,0101,0,'~I like taoists! they can do amazing things after a bit of training (after level 40). Lots of blasty spells... Boom Boom! Ha!'),(10588,10589,0000,0101,0,'~I had a trojan friend once, but then she walked through the gate... and never came back...'),(10589,10593,0000,0101,0,'~But you`d never do that, cause you`re my friend now, right?'),(10593,10584,0000,0102,0,'Sure...~I`ll~be~back~in~my~next~life. 0'),(10590,10591,10600,1001,0,'profession == 20'),(10591,10592,0000,0101,0,'Wah! My only friend left! Walked through the gate and never came back... I`m scared and lonely. Do you wanna be my friend?'),(10592,10583,0000,0102,0,'Um...~okay,~sure! 10232'),(10596,10597,0000,0101,0,'Yay! I`m so happy! Warriors are the best! They can wear long armor and use shields and fight monsters and stuff.'),(10597,10589,0000,0101,0,'~I like friends! I had a friend once, but then he walked through the gate... and never came back...'),(10600,10601,10610,1001,0,'profession == 10'),(10601,10602,0000,0101,0,'Wah! My only friend left! Walked through the gate and never came back... I`m scared and lonely. Do you wanna be my friend?'),(10602,10583,0000,0102,0,'Um...~okay,~sure! 10233'),(10606,10597,0000,0101,0,'Yipee! You`re a trojan, right? Trojans good with two weapons (after level 40). Trojans also good with big weapons.'),(10610,10611,10620,1001,0,'profession == 40'),(10611,10612,0000,0101,0,'Wah! My only friend left! Walked through the gate and never came back... I`m scared and lonely. Do you wanna be my friend?'),(10612,10583,0000,0102,0,'Um...~okay,~sure! 10234'),(10616,10617,0000,0101,0,'Yipee! You`re an archer, right? Archers are good ranged combatants, they can fire arrows from afar! That`s so awesome!'),(10617,10589,0000,0101,0,'~Archers usually jump around, avoiding close combat and getting that ranges advantage on their foes.'),(10620,10621,5018050,1001,0,'profession == 30'),(10621,10622,0000,0101,0,'You~have~chosen~to~be~a~knight.~A~great~choice.'),(10622,10583,0000,0102,0,'Please~tell~more. 10235'),(10626,10588,0000,0101,0,'As~knights~use~mana~to~attack~enemies,~mana~is~very~important~to~knights.'),(5018050,5018060,6021210,1001,0,'profession == 50'),(5018060,5018061,0000,0101,0,'Hello, new blood! Welcome! It is good that you selected the Ninja as your class!'),(5018061,10583,0000,0102,0,'Thank~you. 5018070'),(5018070,10589,0000,0101,0,'Some handy weapons are essential for Ninjas.'),(6021210,6021211,10630,1001,0,'profession == 60'),(6021211,6021212,0000,0101,0,'Hello, there! Welcome! It is so nice to see that another young person has chosen to follow the path of Light!'),(6021212,10583,0000,0102,0,'Thank~you. 6021213'),(6021213,10589,0000,0101,0,'I can tell just by looking at you that you`re going to need some handy weapons! They will be essential for your survival!'),(10630,10631,0000,0101,0,'Welcome~back!~Is~everything~going~on~well~with~you?~My~advice~must~have~been~of~great~help~to~you.'),(10631,10584,0000,0102,0,'Your~advice~is~helpful. 0'),(10640,9580145,10656,1001,0,'level < 15'),(9580145,9580146,0000,0101,0,'Welcome to the world of Conquer! The road to becoming a legend is both long and bumpy. You should work very hard to'),(9580146,9580147,0000,0101,0,'~become great! Here is a quest for you. Please take a message to Kungfu Master in Twin City. You will get a'),(9580147,10643,0000,0101,0,'~reward for your help.'),(10643,10642,0000,0102,0,'As~you~wish. 9580129'),(10642,10644,0000,0102,0,'Any~advice~for~the~road? 10241'),(10644,10645,0000,0102,0,'I`m~not~leaving~yet. 0'),(10645,10646,0000,0104,0,'10 10 6'),(10646,0000,0000,0120,0,''),(10651,10652,0000,0101,0,'You`ll soon be in Twin City. I advise you not to stray too far from the city gates. Don`t leave the Wind Plains'),(10652,10653,0000,0101,0,'~until you`re truly ready. You wouldn`t even cross the river until you`ve visited the job center and got a promotion.'),(10653,10654,0000,0101,0,'~Open your backpack and drag some potions down into the quick item bar (use the F1-F10 keys to activate. That`ll'),(10654,10655,0000,0101,0,'~help you stay alive... Well, good luck.'),(10655,10645,0000,0102,0,'Thanks. 0'),(9580129,8003810,0000,0122,0,'9580138 9580138 9580138 9580138 9580138 9580138 9580138 9580138'),(8003810,3520300,6021863,1001,0,'profession == 10'),(3520300,3520302,0000,0501,1000000,''),(3520302,3520303,0000,0501,1000000,''),(3520303,3531000,0000,0501,1000000,''),(3531000,3531001,3531001,0501,727004,''),(3531001,3520304,0000,1085,0,'gmlog/action_log 340,%user_name[%user_id][%user_lev][%user_pro],0,0,0,0,10000134,2,727004,1'),(3520304,3520305,0000,1028,0,'clr 1'),(3520305,3520306,0000,1003,0,'1002 4