oon! 0'),(9564055,9564056,0000,0101,0,'Did Sugar Tang tell you anything about the Tang Silk?'),(9564056,9564057,0000,0102,0,'I`m~going~to~find~the~answer. 9564320'),(9564057,610077,0000,0102,0,'I`m~just~passing~by. 0'),(9564050,9564051,0000,0101,0,'Did Sugar Tang tell you anything about the Tang Silk?'),(9564051,9564052,0000,0102,0,'I`m~going~to~find~the~answer. 9564320'),(9564052,610077,0000,0102,0,'I`m~just~passing~by. 0'),(9564045,9564046,0000,0101,0,'Did Sugar Tang tell you anything about the Tang Silk?'),(9564046,9564047,0000,0102,0,'I`m~going~to~find~the~answer. 9564320'),(9564047,610077,0000,0102,0,'I`m~just~passing~by. 0'),(9564040,9564041,0000,0101,0,'Why are you still here? Take the Tang Silk to Sugar Tang (685,599) on Bird Island to learn more.'),(9564041,9564042,0000,0102,0,'I`m~on~my~way. 9564320'),(9564042,610077,0000,0102,0,'I~quit! 0'),(9564035,9564036,0000,0101,0,'Calm down, okay? The money you spent will be worthy. See, this Tang Silk is the only thing my grandpa left.'),(9564036,9564037,0000,0102,0,'What~can~I~do~with~the~silk? 9564285'),(9564037,610077,0000,0102,0,'It~looks~nothing~special. 0'),(9564285,9564286,0000,0101,0,'Haha, it`s just a joke! Look, I have the Tang Silk my grandpa left. I want to know more about it, too. But you see,'),(9564286,9564289,0000,0101,0,'~I am a blind man... Well, you just take it to Sugar Tang. If you get something good, don`t forget to tell me!'),(9564289,610077,0000,0102,0,'Okay. 9564300'),(9564300,9564301,9564310,0508,1,''),(9564301,9564302,0000,0501,721798,''),(9564302,9564303,0000,1010,2005,'You obtained the Tang Silk from Villager Chou. Now find Sugar Tang in Bird Island (685,599) to learn more about it.'),(9564303,0000,0000,1056,402,'new'),(9564030,9564031,0000,0101,0,'You brought me the Snake Meat and wine?'),(9564031,9564032,0000,0102,0,'Yeah,~here~you~are. 9564270'),(9564032,610077,0000,0102,0,'Sorry,~I~haven`t... 0'),(9564270,9564272,9564277,0503,721800,''),(9564272,9564273,9564277,0507,0,'710220 710220 5'),(9564273,9564274,0000,0101,0,'Mmm, that`s good. I do like snakes, but only after they`re in my belly. It so happens, that I am the man you`re looking for...'),(9564274,610077,0000,0102,0,'You~made~me~wait~for~that? 9564290'),(9564290,9564292,0000,1056,401,'isexit'),(9564292,9564293,9564277,0503,721800,''),(9564293,9564294,9564277,0507,0,'710220 710220 5'),(9564294,9564295,0000,0506,0,'710220 710220 5'),(9564295,9564296,0000,0502,721800,''),(9564296,9564297,0000,1057,401,'complete set 1'),(9564297,9564298,0000,1001,1,'money += 100'),(9564298,9564299,0000,1085,0,'gmlog/gongjifabao %user_name[%account_id,%user_id],Finished~Attack~Talisman~II,Received~100~silvers'),(9564299,9564285,0000,1010,2005,'You received 100 Silver!'),(9564277,9564278,0000,0101,0,'Did you get the wine and meat I want? The answer is `NO`. My memory is bad when I am starving. Just bring me a bottle of Bamboo'),(9564278,9564279,0000,0101,0,'~Wine from Wine Kiddo (Phoenix Castle 182,280) and 5 pieces of Snake Meat in the northeast of Maple Forest. I await you back!'),(9564279,610077,0000,0102,0,'I`m~on~my~way. 9564287'),(9564287,0000,0000,1010,2005,'Buy the Bamboo Wine from Wine Kiddo (Phoenix Castle 182,280) and collect 5 pieces of Snake Meat from northeast of Maple Forest.'),(9564025,9564026,0000,0101,0,'He is just in this village. Is that related with Sugar Tang? Oh, I know. Herbalist Chou was Frost Tang`s best friend. So she thought the Herbalist Chou`s grandson might know something, right?'),(9564026,9564027,0000,0102,0,'Yeah,~you~guessed~correctly. 9564120'),(9564027,610077,0000,0102,0,'I`m~not~sure. 0'),(9564120,9564121,0000,0101,0,'Of course, I know where he is! Sorry, I feel a little hungry. Would you mind bringing me some Bamboo Wine from'),(9564121,9564122,0000,0101,0,'~Wine Kiddo (Phoenix Castle 182,280)? Hey! And Snake Meat in the northeast of Maple Forest is amazing. Get me five!'),(9564122,9564123,0000,0101,0,''),(9564123,610077,0000,0102,0,'Greedy~son~of~a.. 9564125'),(9564125,956