You~bet. 0'),(9567880,9567881,0000,0101,0,'Actually, the Star Tower has been broken into three pieces. It`s said one of the pieces was brought to the Desert. Just days before, a group of bandits'),(9567881,9567882,0000,0101,0,'~in Desert were killed overnight, there.'),(9567882,9567883,0000,0102,0,'Where~can~I~find~it? 9567885'),(9567883,610115,0000,0102,0,'I`d~better~return~home. 0'),(9567885,9567886,0000,0101,0,'As I know, the third Tower Splinter is in the deep of Desert. Go to (166,226) and see what you can find out there. Be careful, though. The long-standing war has'),(9567886,9567887,0000,0101,0,'~ruined the landscape, leaving only homeless villagers and savage bandits in its wake...'),(9567887,610115,0000,0102,0,'I`ll~be~careful. 9567890'),(9567890,9567892,9567891,1056,525,'isexit'),(9567892,0000,0000,0105,0,'Head~to~the~deep~of~Desert~at~(166,226)~to~start~an~investigation.'),(9567891,9567892,0000,1056,525,'new'),(9567860,9567861,0000,0101,0,'Days before, a group of bandits in the Desert were killed, overnight. Nobody knows who did it or for what. So, what are you doing here?'),(9567861,9567862,0000,0101,0,''),(9567862,9567863,0000,0102,0,'Do~you~know~the~Star~Tower? 9567865'),(9567863,610115,0000,0102,0,'I`m~just~passing~by. 0'),(9567865,9567866,0000,0101,0,'Star Tower? Yeah, but I should tell you the road ahead will be long and dangerous. Are you sure you want to continue?'),(9567866,9567867,0000,0101,0,''),(9567867,610115,0000,0102,0,'I~can`t~be~sure~more. 9567870'),(9567870,9567871,0000,1057,524,'complete set 1'),(9567871,9567872,0000,1001,1,'money += 100'),(9567872,9567873,0000,1085,0,'gmlog/fangyufabao %user_name[%account_id,%user_id],Equipment~Bonus,Defense~Talisman,V,100~silvers'),(9567873,9567885,0000,1010,2005,'You received 100 Silver!'),(9567850,9567851,0000,0101,0,'False friends are worse than bitter enemies.'),(9567851,9567852,0000,0101,0,''),(9567852,610115,0000,0102,0,'You~think? 0'),(9567900,9567901,9567910,1056,526,'isexit'),(9567901,956790